"Entering the address directly reaches only a desk without a floor. Six "
"ordinary records must first acquire reverse sides on this device; only then "
"do date, lunar phase, and the duty bell begin choosing an entrance."
msgstr ""
"Entering the address directly reaches only a desk without a floor. Six "
"ordinary records must first acquire reverse sides on this device; only then "
"do date, lunar phase, and the duty bell begin choosing an entrance."

