#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/lockedNote"
msgid ""
"Do not complete a checklist. Study, vote, close, decline, drop, and defend "
"as usual. If the ninth period needs you, it will leave its own blank in the "
"timetable."
msgstr ""
"Do not complete a checklist. Study, vote, close, decline, drop, and defend "
"as usual. If the ninth period needs you, it will leave its own blank in the "
"timetable."

